  "403s could not be read at all and is the likeliest place a feed is being",
  "missed; `note` says which case a null is.",
  "",
  "`items_seen` is how many entries that feed carried when probed. A feed is",
  "a current window of 10-50 items, never an archive, so this register",
  "supports discovering what is new and cannot answer a question about 2019."
